206,"""Referral is key to unlocking talent in the ever-evolving tech industry. As a technical talent manager, referrals can significantly impact your recruitment strategy. To utilize referrals effectively, start by building relationships with skilled professionals who are actively looking for a new opportunity. Leverage their network to identify top talent who possess the skills and expertise you're looking for. Once you've identified the right candidate, provide them with a tailored referral package that includes information about the job description, company culture, and required skills. This will increase the chances of them accepting the offer."""
