238,"Here's a 100-word LinkedIn post for a technical role: ""Hi team, I wanted to share a valuable tip on how to leverage referrals in our industry. When referring a colleague or team member for a technical role, it's essential to highlight their skills and experience. A simple ask can make a huge difference. When referring a candidate, use a brief but informative email, such as ""Hi [Name], I'm considering [Company Name] for [Job Title] with your skills. I thought I'd reach out and suggest [Your Name] as a strong candidate. Their expertise in [Key skill] could be a great asset to our team. Please pass along my email if you think it could be a good fit. Looking forward to hearing from them!"""
