242,"Here's a 100-word, text-only LinkedIn post: ""Technical Role: Advanced Networking Specialist Are you looking to expand your professional network? Our Advanced Networking Specialist role is perfect for someone looking to make connections in the industry. To get involved, follow these steps: * Reach out to the contact information listed on our website * Be clear about your career goals and what you're looking for in a referral * Show enthusiasm and interest in the industry, but avoid being too pushy or promotional * Be prepared to discuss your skills and qualifications, but also be willing to learn and listen If you think you'd be a great fit, send us a message for more information"""
