244,"""Recent restructuring at our company has affected several technical roles. Specifically, our Lead DevOps Engineer position has been eliminated effective immediately. The affected candidate will receive support in finding new roles within the company and assistance in transitioning to an open position. We appreciate the skills and contributions made by the departing engineer and wish them the best in their future endeavors."""
